BT /F1 13 Tf 40 740 Td (5. R1 Robotic Surgical Insertion System & Computer Vision Navigation) Tj
0 -18 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (Because 4-micrometer flexible polyimide ribbons buckle under axial load, manual insertion with surgical forceps is impossible.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (The Neuralink R1 Robotic Surgical System executes automated, micron-precision insertion while avoiding surface cerebral vasculature.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (5.1. Robotic Hardware & Optical Diagnostics) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Gantry Kinematics: 5-axis Cartesian-rotational positioning stage with sub-micron (0.2 um) encoder resolution and 100 nm repeatability.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Optical Coherence Tomography (OCT): 1310 nm swept-source OCT providing 8 um axial resolution for real-time pial surface depth tracking.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Multi-Camera Stereo Vision: Dual 4K optical sensors with polarized annular LED ring illumination to eliminate specular brain reflections.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Insertion Needle Assembly: 40 um outer diameter tungsten-carbide needle with a laser-machined micro-hook and vacuum pincher.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (5.2. Automated Vascular Segmentation & Path Planning) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Vascular Mapping: Deep convolutional neural network (U-Net) segments superficial cortical arteries and veins down to 15 um diameter.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Safe Corridor Computation: Insertion trajectory planner solves constrained optimization to enforce > 75 um clearance from any vessel.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Dynamic Insertion Profile: Needle accelerates at 1.2 mm/s through pia mater to prevent tenting, decelerating at target Layer V depth.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Retraction Mechanism: Vacuum collet releases the thread loop, needle retracts cleanly, achieving 64 threads (1024 electrodes) in < 22 minutes.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Intraoperative Hemorrhage Rate: 0.0% surface vascular ruptures recorded across clinical PRIME study participant surgeries.) Tj
ET
