BT /F1 13 Tf 40 740 Td (6. Hermetic Biocompatible Packaging, Wireless Telemetry & Inductive Power) Tj
0 -18 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (The N1 implant is housed in a hermetically sealed circular package measuring 23.0 mm in diameter and 8.0 mm in total axial thickness.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (The package is flush-mounted into a precision trephine craniectomy pocket in the calvarium, sealed without skin-penetrating wires.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (6.1. Materials, Enclosure & Micro-Feedthroughs) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Enclosure Material: Medical-grade Grade-5 Titanium Alloy (Ti-6Al-4V ELI) laser welded with hermetic helium leak rate < 5e-10 atm-cc/sec.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Top Substrate: Polished single-crystal sapphire (Al2O3) radiofrequency window allowing 2.4 GHz RF and 6.78 MHz magnetic flux propagation.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Feedthrough Interconnect: 1024-channel high-density co-fired multi-layer platinum/gold ceramic feedthrough (pitch: 120 um).) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Thermal Dissipation: Operating power < 12.0 mW ensures cortical surface temperature elevation remains < 0.8 deg C (ISO 14708-3 compliant).) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (6.2. Wireless Telemetry Link & Cryptographic Security) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Radio Protocol: Custom ultra-low-power Bluetooth Low Energy 5.3 physical layer operating in the 2.402 to 2.480 GHz ISM frequency band.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Sustained Telemetry Data Rate: 2.2 Mbps throughput with forward error correction (FEC) and packet retransmission (ARQ).) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Cryptographic Architecture: Hardware AES-128-GCM authenticated encryption for all neural packet payloads; ECDSA-P256 device pairing.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (6.3. Inductive Power Transfer & Battery Subsystem) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Battery Cell: Custom hermetic lithium-polymer rechargeable cell (250 mAh capacity, 3.8V nominal, 12.5 hours active streaming runtime).) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Wireless Charging: 6.78 MHz magnetic resonant coupling from external headwear coil; 0 to 100% recharge in 75 minutes at 1.5W input.) Tj
ET
endstream
