BT /F1 13 Tf 40 740 Td (7. Real-Time Motor Intention Decoding Algorithms & Latency Pipeline) Tj
0 -18 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (Neural signals received by the user terminal are converted into continuous 2D/3D cursor velocity vectors and discrete click states.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (The closed-loop decoding pipeline executes at 50 Hz update rate (every 20 ms) with end-to-end user perceived latency < 18 ms.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (7.1. Decoding Architecture: Kalman Filter & Recurrent Neural Network) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (1. Spatial Feature Extraction: 1024-channel SBP features are normalized and projected onto the top 32 Principal Components (PCA).) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (2. Continuous State Estimation: A steady-state Recurrent Kalman Filter (RKF) models neural state transitions and cursor kinematics:) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (   State Equation: x_t = A * x_{t-1} + w_t | Observation Equation: z_t = H * x_t + v_t | Kalman Gain: K_t = P_t * H^T * (H P_t H^T + R)^{-1}) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (3. Deep Recurrent Decoder: A dual-layer Gated Recurrent Unit (GRU) neural network with 128 hidden units captures non-linear motor intent.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (4. Discrete Click Classifier: Multi-class softmax classifier detects intended index finger tap, left-click, right-click, and click-and-drag.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (5. Adaptive Unsupervised Recalibration: Online background retraining updates Kalman matrices (A, H) every 60 seconds without pausing control.) Tj
0 -15 Td /F1 11 Tf (8. The PRIME Clinical Trial: Human Quadriplegia Benchmark Results) Tj
0 -12 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (The ongoing PRIME Study (Precise Robotically Implanted Brain-Computer Interface) evaluated clinical efficacy in quadriplegic participants:) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Cursor Control Bit Rate: Participant achieved peak bitrate of 10.2 Bits Per Second (BPS) on standard Fitts Law target acquisition task.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (  (Comparative clinical benchmark: legacy wired Utah array record = 4.8 BPS; non-invasive EEG BCIs = 0.5 - 1.2 BPS).) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Typing Velocity: Achieved 38.4 correct words per minute (WPM) on virtual QWERTY on-screen keyboard without physical assistance.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Daily Operational Usage: Sustained average of 9.4 hours per day for web browsing, digital design (CAD), online chess, and video gaming.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Thread Micro-Retraction & Algorithmic Recovery: Initial post-surgical thread retraction was compensated by re-weighting remaining active) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (  channels, restoring >95% peak decoding throughput and demonstrating software decoder fault tolerance.) Tj
0 -10.5 Td /F3 8.5 Tf (- Safety Milestones: 0 infections, 0 intracranial hematomas, 0 device-related neurological deficits across >365 cumulative implant days.) Tj
ET
endstream
